# WFORMTC.KEY - failed saves: the server's FIELD= refusals, the record
# gone, the session ended; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTC.SNP.
# A tag the server refuses: its FIELD=TAGS puts the server's text on the
# message line and the focus on Tags.
K F3 ALT-G
T a*b
K ENTER
S TAGS
# An unknown location: refused before the save, "No location ZZ" on the
# message line and the focus on Location.
K ALT-G DEL ALT-L
T ZZ
K ENTER
S LOCATION
# A known one: the save goes, and the item is shown again.
T B2
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER
# F8: item 3, deleted under the dialog; its save fails with 200: a
# message box, then the dialog ends with WF_GONE.
K F8
K ALT-M
T Acme
K ENTER
S GONEBOX
K ENTER
S GONE
# SHIFT-F9: the session ended under the dialog: the box of rqe_class,
# then WF_QUIT.
K SHIFT-F9
K ALT-M
T Acme
K ENTER
S ENDEDBOX
K ENTER
S ENDED
